  <item>
    <title>23 马跃迷案|地铁站消逝的大学生</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6895438e638b01587985173e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6895438e638b01587985173e</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 08 Aug 2025 00:35:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【导读】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>2013年8月23号的晚上，一个普通的夏日傍晚，却有一个中年女士在这个热闹非凡的地方为自己的儿子马跃摆设了一个小小的纪念场，纪念场上摆放着洁白的花朵、幽幽的烛光，还有就是相框中，那依旧阳光帅气的男孩-马跃。年纪轻轻的马跃究竟因为什么离开了这个世界？这起案件引起了怎样的轩然大波。。。。。。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a> 故事开篇。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="51">00:51</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="304">05:04</a>大学生马跃之死</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="305">05:05</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="594">09:54</a>第一次尸检报告出炉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="595">09:55</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1024">17:04</a>意料之中的第二份尸检报告</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1025">17:05</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1094">18:14</a>王雪梅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1095">18:15</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1405">23:25</a>消失的监控视频</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1406">23:26</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1581">26:21</a>疑点重重</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1582">26:22</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2142">35:42</a>王雪梅的推论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2143">35:43</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2293">38:13</a>没有结局的故事结尾</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【相关图片】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>8月23日是马跃的三周年祭日，马跃母亲孟朝红在北京鼓楼大街地铁站外为儿子布置了一个纪念场</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuR-aBcsT4cuvVZ6g8p1Cz1NiTZz.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>纪念活动现场，路人在签名板上签名悼念马跃</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg-3GkYWEvcsYt936EJ7SWalMs5N.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>王雪梅</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuuUL1kaS5LrCUc-6oPoUjq1Uf58.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6662594194977a26efc15a3d/lijP6J018QUBAnlQkwFYQZeK53u7.m4a" length="37131259" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:38:13</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo3vuAj3Ibt9T-IPflwY8KVo1lBA.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>22 李宗元的“难民”申请</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6831c2a741ef875a12019c32</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6831c2a741ef875a12019c32</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 26 May 2025 22:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【导读】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>在2023年的2月，《新西兰先驱报》花了半个版面刊登了一篇文章，在这篇文章上，一个双手合十的中年男人照片显得格外醒目，这个中年男人叫做李宗元，报道他的原因其实是一件小事情，简单说来就是新西兰移民部拒绝了李宗元的难民申请，但是这背后的原因却一点也不简单，并且这篇报导，重新揭开了一件已经过去20年之久的凶杀案。这个案件的案情简单、清晰，证据确凿，但是它当年造成的影响却非同小可，这个案件在当时甚至引起了中国和加拿大的外交风波。而在最终法庭宣判后，这个案件又一次引起了大众对司法公正的再次激烈争辩。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">01:05</a> 故事开篇。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="66">01:06</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="487">08:07</a>一个失踪报警电话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="488">08:08</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="981">16:21</a>箱子中的尸体和逃出国境的嫌犯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="982">16:22</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1294">21:34</a>另一个嫌犯的投案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1295">21:35</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1502">25:02</a>被拖延的案件和外交风波</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1503">25:03</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2055">34:15</a>“尘埃落定“</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2056">34:16</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2491">41:31</a>难民</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2492">41:32</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2616">43:36</a>结束语</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【相关图片】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>双手合十的李宗元登上了《新西兰先驱报》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frkb2acqgMj7LtYNRP4iwgih2ScD.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>赵巍</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvJkQf7Qj9b_fxDQZYHMpzXWC_g-.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>李昂和赵巍</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu4TdeoXtQkPGHW1UpGeuWTZf3RO.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>赵巍母亲致新西兰移民局的手写控诉书</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmfgmaPHaKza4hAYJCoUfztJTCCK.webp"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6662594194977a26efc15a3d/ln-lxNJ-NQ8hhvLJr5gB4RGBb9Ls.m4a" length="42358231" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:43:36</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkGwDJprnZ6PeHz1h2ZwonG0vlIU.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>21 女儿变妹妹|韩国最离奇的真实案件</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67ffd95acdd692da15cb1513</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67ffd95acdd692da15cb1513</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 16 Apr 2025 17:27:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【导读】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>2021年韩国庆尚北道龟尾市，发生了一起性质恶劣的案件，3岁女童被母亲活活饿死在家中，而当警方介入调查时，案情居然出现了惊天大逆转，这个案件在当时的韩国引起了不小的轰动，原因居然是案情太过扑朔迷离。这究竟是一起怎样的迷案呢？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="82">01:22</a>故事开篇。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="83">01:23</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="329">05:29</a>小宝蓝的诞生以及幸福的一家三口</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">05:30</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="575">09:35</a>家庭破裂，金宝英的新生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="576">09:36</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="934">15:34</a>宝蓝之死，警方介入调查</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="935">15:35</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1124">18:44</a>惊天大逆转，迷离的案中案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1125">18:45</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1693">28:13</a>警方的调查</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1694">28:14</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2024">33:44</a>推测</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2025">33:45</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2123">35:23</a>法庭的审判</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2124">35:24</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2168">36:08</a>结束语</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6662594194977a26efc15a3d/luFKTsQHxLXbVq46hUQmuD_P7uEC.m4a" length="35074994" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:36:08</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk39NYIB2njMoflNNgUOWJEy6fip.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>20 保险箱里的谜题和隐秘的身份</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67c90111e924d4525a970213</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67c90111e924d4525a970213</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 06 Mar 2025 06:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【导读】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>神秘女子嫁入豪门，然而她的行为却古怪离奇</span></p><span></span><p><span>三十年前的她已经葬身火海，为何三十年后的她又能饮弹自尽</span></p><span></span><p><span>神秘的保险箱里发现奇怪的信件</span></p><span></span><p><span>这个女子到底是谁？美国政府的资深专家调查多年未果</span></p><span></span><p><span>然而最终，一位核物理学家居然揭开了谜底。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="68">01:08</a> 故事开篇。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="69">01:09</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="158">02:38</a> 饮弹自尽的女人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="159">02:39</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="910">15:10</a>乔恩和洛瑞的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="911">15:11</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1414">23:34</a>神秘的保险箱和诡异的私家侦探调查结果</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1355">22:35</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2155">35:55</a>乔·韦林和他职业生涯中最难办的案子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2156">35:56</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2350">39:10</a>谜题一般的案件引起了全世界网友的兴趣和推测</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2351">39:11</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2538">42:18</a>科学家的重要发现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2539">42:19</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2660">44:20</a>真相的降临</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2661">44:21</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2748">45:48</a>结束语</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【相关图片】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>洛瑞·艾丽卡·肯尼迪驾照上的照片</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlScczmVPawJus1TQA8Ymi2xCCr2.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>乔恩和洛瑞</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtiGQMoHFVJatrDI8_AKyI040zRq.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>乔·韦林</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvW3uhSYn8BSdkWi4AwYZciRudKM.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>洛瑞的不同身份证件</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpQGdhyjalgaSI1Nv_vi4psQNmW-.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>洛瑞（左）和塔拉·卡利科的对比照</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjyZ9BWTNh2EcNEjJrbI3pTheFT-.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>洛瑞（左）和杰奎琳·勒巴伦的对比照</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsYhLGgk2dUfWiHTeZ0wciLAkkTE.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>科林·费茨帕特里克</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsB8XVLSS9hOi3_l9Bg4I6NDFSMd.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6662594194977a26efc15a3d/ll4QnANGwebBE3iqKNshpwKvyo2u.m4a" length="44492147" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:45:48</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqut4pvK3pbn_eZ5fI4CiTbezaGQ.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>19 未婚夫死亡事件| 台湾“特工”的双面人生</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67b382bf606e5c59401a46a6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67b382bf606e5c59401a46a6</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 17 Feb 2025 18:55:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【导读】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>再过十天就要步入婚姻殿堂的情侣，未婚夫却突然死于非命。奇怪的报警电话和一连串浮出水面的线索，让案件跌宕起伏。当嫌疑人最终进入警方的视线时，这个人的身份却让人大跌眼镜。当电视剧中夸张的剧情发生在了现实里，它的结局又会是什么呢？今天就为大家带来这起在当时轰动了台湾的离奇案件。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="63">01:03</a> 故事开篇。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="64">01:04</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="497">08:17</a> 鱼塘沉尸和奇怪的报警电话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="498">08:18</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="737">12:17</a>死者的身世及遭遇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="738">12:18</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="859">14:19</a>绑架撕票</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1278">21:18</a>线索</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1279">21:19</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1776">29:36</a>关于“她”的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1777">29:37</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2413">40:13</a>案件真相大白</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2414">40:14</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2473">41:13</a>法庭的审判</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2474">41:14</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2533">42:13</a>结束语</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【相关图片】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>陈人诚</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoSTxjlQti8lItkzPw1sJCBcdMaI.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>罗美云</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FviRtRdTiqe6kM-Joi_3OmB8mXNP.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6662594194977a26efc15a3d/lg2B2xaz0-9CHu0DZeNI19qrOj4M.m4a" length="41005971" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:42:13</itunes:duration>
