  <item>
    <title>18 定罪|被指认的杀人凶手</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6789b99ad1c89f5798764990</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6789b99ad1c89f5798764990</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 17 Jan 2025 02:01:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【导读】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>1998年，在美国俄亥俄州阿克伦市发生了一起惨绝人寰的凶杀案，59岁的茱蒂丝被奸杀，正当警方一头雾水的时候，一个年仅6岁的女童站了出来，并指认了杀人凶手，然而我们能够相信她的指认吗？这里面又发生了什么故事？最后谁才是真正的凶手呢……</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="63">01:03</a> 故事开篇。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="64">01:04</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="247">04:07</a> 惨死家中的老妇人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="248">04:08</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="379">06:19</a>幸存者的求救以及诡异的施救人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">06:20</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="909">15:09</a>被举报的嫌犯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="910">15:10</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1479">24:39</a>嫌犯背后的女人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1480">24:40</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1608">26:48</a>私家侦探</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1609">26:49</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1952">32:32</a>真相浮出水面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1953">32:33</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a>母亲的秘密</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2221">37:01</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2522">42:02</a>案件水落石出</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2523">42:03</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2643">44:03</a>结束语</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【相关图片】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>女童布鲁克</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrAFOIKBnH-RBTTzkj2mJMc6sw_x.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>克拉伦斯</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Foa-LOjUGPVRt43D4qQtxJ-aIag8.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>克拉伦斯和梅琳达</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk0q9v0tnXJHPq2YfCZU5RdAPIvv.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>马丁·杨特</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkeWTqlnQh5OCmxL82rzwye0LwIl.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>在法庭外拥抱的克拉伦斯和梅琳达</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjjf-vSJI8NvnxhDxbH34LmhwNHg.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>厄尔.吉恩曼</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtS6pyqtFcGMxA-Fbnt9mn67i5V-.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>克拉伦斯和长大了的布鲁克</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgm3X2JHGuxMb3fn4Az54QTosk_s.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6662594194977a26efc15a3d/lq7uP3eooXDH03GF2ZqO4DoAU1gp.m4a" length="42793748" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:44:03</itunes:duration>
