  <item>
    <title>17 深夜异乡客：“你”到底是谁？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/676614661e823e72d3841f1e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">676614661e823e72d3841f1e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 21 Dec 2024 01:15:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【导读】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>2005年12月16日，陕西省定边县警方接到了一个普通的失窃案报警电话，然而经过警方的现场勘察以及案情的发展，警方发现这根本不是一起普通的失窃案，当警方以为这是一起失踪案的时候，更多的证据告诉警方这其实是一起复杂的刑事案件。当你以为你接近真相的时候，却会发现更多的谜团等你去揭开……</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="53">00:53</a> 故事开篇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="54">00:54</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="615">10:15</a> 陕西省定边县公安局接到了一个失窃案，在勘察现场的过程中，警方意外发现这似乎并不是一起普通的盗窃案，而其中还牵涉了一起失踪案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="616">10:16</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1344">22:24</a> 经过警方的摸排调查，初步确定案件嫌疑人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1345">22:25</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1855">30:55</a> 经过漫长的寻找，警方终于找到了犯罪嫌疑人，然而，犯罪嫌疑人却有着充分的不在场证明？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1856">30:56</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">36:00</a> 找到真正的嫌疑犯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2161">36:01</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2504">41:44</a> 经过又一次的物证检验，找到了案件的直接证物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2505">41:45</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2748">45:48</a> 案件真相大白，尘埃落定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2749">45:49</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2817">46:57</a> 结尾</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【相关图片】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>1、乔丽</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmwcAVOnOhfmr188RIaU4XszU0F9.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>2、权威</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhcpZCBOdepR_aKfiyCXFcPaR2Y-.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>3、卫生间门后墙上的血迹</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fud88Q2BJMaoLWLOWIA0QnVZV9dD.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>4、在餐柜顶端发现的菜刀</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fol4Z6z2HEhnVS86WU8Up0RK8g95.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lra3fCyvRUIcE8eqE3_Vqe0nrLPL.m4a" length="45678178" type="audio/mp4"/>
