    <guid isPermaLink="false">674d0d69c3b2a2f334eed663</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 02 Dec 2024 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【导读】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>在气候宜人的热带海滨城市海口的环海公路旁惊现一具无头裸体男尸，警方在侦破的过程中，发现死者并不仅仅是受害者这么简单。而杀害死者的凶手却更为神秘。警方抽丝剥茧，由这起案件又牵扯出了另外一起无人知晓的凶杀案…</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="78">01:18</a> 故事开篇。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="99">01:39</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="362">06:02</a> 海口市临海公路旁惊现一具无头裸体男尸，警方接警后，展开了现场勘察，并成立了专案组.</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="363">06:03</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1480">24:40</a>警方抽丝剥茧，查出了死者的身份，以及死者的经历。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1481">24:41</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1897">31:37</a>嫌疑人现身并落网，她交代了这起案件的过程，然而故事却还没有结束…</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1898">31:38</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2361">39:21</a>另一起无人知晓的命案被揭开</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2362">39:22</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2436">40:36</a>故事结尾</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【相关图片】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>武权友</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhTow0_geGOPcAEZqGaMN8d9uWju.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>龚云娟</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpB7lP_xT6oufecKtr2nhB5xIdx5.png"></figure>]]></description>
