  <item>
    <title>15 焚化炉里的告别｜台湾洪家豪宅的秘密</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/672ecdf3f373fe5d4dd6b688</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">672ecdf3f373fe5d4dd6b688</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 09 Nov 2024 03:05:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【导读】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>台湾众源企业股份有限公司的员工联系不上他们的老板洪若潭，无奈只能上门寻找。然而员工却发现了诡异可可怕的事情，随即报警。警察在对洪家大宅侦查的时候，发现了一样与这个豪宅格格不入的东西，随之而来的是洪宅的秘密逐渐被揭开，然而真相到底是什么呢？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="95">01:35</a> 故事开篇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="96">01:36</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="383">06:23</a> 员工无法联系到洪若潭，于是上门寻找，没想到发现了异常情况，当即报警</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="384">06:24</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="744">12:24</a> 警方立即出警，在对现场的侦查过程中，发现了一件诡异的物品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="745">12:25</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">17:20</a> 洪若潭的家庭背景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1041">17:21</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1559">25:59</a> 警方似乎揭开了其中的秘密</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2064">34:24</a> 本案最大的疑团：孩子们去哪里了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2065">34:25</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2198">36:38</a> 案件还是疑点众多，很多警方还原的事实不能令人信服</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2199">36:39</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2286">38:06</a> 故事结尾</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【相关图片】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>1. 洪家豪宅</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fuo--fD733OIJbTOA9Qi8N2NiqI3.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>2. 众源公司老板洪若潭及其员工</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuFD_aH6_Z9Y1lOj8BEsEF7iucvw.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>3. 焚化炉原图</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnM7fAjnpLuG3_f3sfygiEOQJxYC.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>4. 焚化炉结构示意图</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FibKMyhLH_60wTBiU51pTNdZE_Gp.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>5. 老师提供的洪家全家福</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh4gpxCSN9VxLZ8XS6IZ8dOHvv0H.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>【BGM】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>开篇音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《鹿港小镇》 by 罗大佑</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Classical vibes-5》 by Grigoriy Nuzhny</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lr-N26MWcPNoX56P1lSFTVD52kmw.m4a" length="36980501" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:38:06</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvbrMLsHSmW3GQoxTkvVDyP5nBr8.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>14 “椅子山”的悲歌</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671ffc371d2e86f67aa00366</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">671ffc371d2e86f67aa00366</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 29 Oct 2024 01:12:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【导读】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>湖北省鄂州市葛店开发区一个叫做“椅子山”的地方，惊现了一具未成年女尸，其死状惨烈。然而就在这起案件侦破的同时，该地区又浮现了若干起奇怪的案件，并且这些案件和椅子山的命案有许多相似的地方。那么这个女孩的死和这些案件有关联吗？在外围侦查屡屡受挫的情况下，警察又是凭借了什么抓到嫌犯的呢？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">00:45</a> 故事开篇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="46">00:46</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="132">02:12</a> 在湖北省鄂州市葛店开发区的椅子山上发现了一具未成年女尸。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="133">02:13</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="437">07:17</a> 警方立即出警，并进行了现场侦查和取证，由于案情重大，当地公安成立了专案组。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="438">07:18</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1482">24:42</a> 在案件侦查过程中，警方屡屡看到希望，但希望却又破灭。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1483">24:43</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1805">30:05</a> 警方决定从物证下手，重新梳理案情并很快锁定嫌疑人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1806">30:06</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2037">33:57</a> 案件真相以及最后的结局</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2038">33:58</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2102">35:02</a> 结束语</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【相关图片】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>1. 犯罪现场的白布条</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkbH4yiulheuOH82pEM2YovJXtSG.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>2. 刘胜国</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkhR9MFQrUEo9U7b60Kap0mIa-t7.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>3. 犯罪嫌疑人的车辆</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpFXCUxYUPl1fsEaUpv7bNTvrmRG.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>4. 胡际金</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flp6-U9cNncjAPGMQJWPd_NO2Yx2.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>【BGM】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>开篇音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《I wanna know》</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>by MichaelRamir C.</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>结尾音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《I’ ve been careful》</span></p><span></span><p><span>by Eugenio Mininni</span></p>]]></description>
