  <item>
    <title>13 来自巴尔的摩的谋杀案|一起不停反转的案件</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6701e2a46c7f817786fd53eb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6701e2a46c7f817786fd53eb</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 06 Oct 2024 01:06:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【导读】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>2000年美国东海岸马里兰州的巴尔的摩县发生了一起凶残的谋杀案，然而在过了11年以后，案件的线索才逐渐浮出水面。但是这起案件的线索错综复杂，牵扯到了实施杀人的凶手，杀人中介和背后的幕后指使。但到底谁才是案件的幕后指使呢？直至案件宣判，案情仍然在反转。但人们推测，案件的真相只有一个，那就是。。。。。。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="59">00:59</a> 故事开篇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="734">12:14</a> 巴尔的摩县女孩海蒂·路易斯惨死家中，经过警方的侦查，却无法发现案件的真相，并且成为悬案被搁置了11年之久。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="735">12:15</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1009">16:49</a> 案件有了突破性进展，警方锁定了一名嫌疑人。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1010">16:50</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1701">28:21</a> 警方获得了证人以及证词，并抓获了嫌犯。最终法庭进行了宣判。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1702">28:22</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2211">36:51</a> 然而看似尘埃落定的案件，却是疑点重重，并且被认定为幕后指使的被告一直在申诉，并被法院受理。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2212">36:52</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2293">38:13</a> 案件的真相只有一种可能，那就是。。。。。。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2294">38:14</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2342">39:02</a> 结束语</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【相关图片】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>1. 受害人：海蒂·路易斯</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqniEeV6Oj6jA8Dyf7MDqYneUmPY.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>2. 海蒂的丈夫：斯蒂芬·库克</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiuUURk2xjbuQhw8jpgO0sk4vaLY.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>3. 斯蒂芬和海蒂位于马里兰州邓多克的家</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnGkIZD1X7pbZ2rmv5Cbis62GT-o.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>4. 埃里克斯·贝内特</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjG2r-EoJNXtvVTWZYXX2-ysDjFv.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>5. 格兰特·刘易斯</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmtP6Du5Pjy_O9IloDqinugGvy18.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>6. 海蒂未生效的保单通知</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo1Md_NeWl08wpVr9GD55yKT7rD7.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span>【案件部分素材来源】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.stephencookejr.com/" data-url="https://www.stephencookejr.com/"><span>www.stephencookejr.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【BGM】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>开篇音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Forever in my heart》</span></p><span></span><p><span>by Michael Ramir C.</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Classical vibes-5》</span></p><span></span><p><span>by Grigoriy Nuzhny</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmt8PoXpYtLDAQduDPGHD29BWEyr.m4a" length="37891007" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:39:02</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmdN4kMCnAE8z_uk0dXhBHuFUPpu.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
