  <item>
    <title>12 他是杀人凶手吗？| 被迷雾笼罩的案件</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66f4129469b6a485e8e2a186</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66f4129469b6a485e8e2a186</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 25 Sep 2024 13:39:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【导读】</span></p><span></span><p><span>2000年初的陕西省咸阳市发生了一起凶杀案，死者是检察长的夫人。这起案件当时引起了很大的关注，公安部派遣了全国刑侦八虎之首的乌国庆带领专家团队协助破案。但是案件最终的结果却让人觉得疑点重重。这倒底是一起什么样的案件呢？就让我们的故事带大家一起进入这起迷雾重重的案件吧。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="62">01:02</a>故事开篇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="63">01:03</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="432">07:12</a>咸阳警方接警，得知检察长妻子死在家中</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="433">07:13</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="706">11:46</a>案件被省市领导重视，成立929专案组，并开启紧锣密鼓的案件调查</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="707">11:47</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">12:30</a> 陈平为亡妻举行了隆重的悼念会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="751">12:31</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1192">19:52</a> 专案组感受到巨大压力，但是却发现了一些新线索</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1193">19:53</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1628">27:08</a> 公安部派出以乌国庆为首的专家组协助专案组进行调查，调查取得进展，并且刑事拘留了陈平</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1629">27:09</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1988">33:08</a> 嫌犯被逮捕，并提交了作案经过，后续警方相继给出一些技术鉴定。以及最终的宣判。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1989">33:09</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2548">42:28</a> 辩护律师以及社会上一些法律界人士和专家对本案给出的一些不同解读和质疑。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2549">42:29</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2725">45:25</a> 结束语</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【相关图片】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>1. 案发小区：陕西省咸阳市福园小区</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsCSVjxXBgF0SL-M9Xy8o0HxFTWt.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>2. 陈平</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtXqvba7obpbngfiSe3Bwa3TJ2sS.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>3. 全国刑侦八虎之首：乌国庆</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuMLQ_uuo4pRUsunQ3LsLD_A48uR.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/loD7i-D48yyA92aGjrg50heeL_GN.m4a" length="44116031" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:45:25</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flqwp5TyzOlaCl_6wg-4X5rP22Kv.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>11 埋在水泥下的尸骨｜多伦多华人命案纪实</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66e33e083a5ff0a0ca0e58d7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66e33e083a5ff0a0ca0e58d7</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 12 Sep 2024 19:16:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【导读】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>近十多年来，加拿大的房地产市场可谓是热火朝天，这也使得房产经纪这一行业变得炙手可热，然而你可能看到的只是他们光鲜亮丽的一面，让你不敢相信的是，这样一个平凡的行业也是充斥了人身危险。今天，让我们的故事带您走进一个关于加拿大金牌房产经纪遇害的案件。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="119">01:59</a> 故事开篇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a> 多伦多皮尔警局接到了一起失踪报案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="211">03:31</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="755">12:35</a> 警方发现重要线索；</span></p><span></span><p><span>又一起失踪案出现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="756">12:36</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1266">21:06</a> 警方对案情的推断；</span></p><span></span><p><span>第二个神秘失踪人现身警局。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1267">21:07</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1424">23:44</a> 发现失踪者的尸体，凶手浮出水面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1425">23:45</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1849">30:49</a> 案件真相大白</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1850">30:50</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a> 最终的审判</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1921">32:01</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2010">33:30</a> 结束语</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【相关图片】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>1，位于密西沙加的涉事豪宅</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FooAQlnHYgieIgzolxzaOSWwBUyy.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>2，韩建国再获2010年公司销售冠军</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmaG6pa1c5aihCwfWjdVF-EGchFF.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>4，发现韩建国车辆的Tim Hortons</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsy_yd4-MiAq6tZIvSyiOhnZ22-u.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>5，韩建国（左）与费军</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmpI7hyUKqIvuByztxpPALBQrHZj.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>2，伍国伟</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqntcufXtgkb5PZBrD7xnUseL74D.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luH-ljg_zMB7mYGVBem_vzvBbb4Y.m4a" length="32552477" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:33:30</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrFV-q2luwN0mKldiFZY3DS9f0zK.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>10 权利的游戏 | 蒙古名媛命丧大马案</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d8e86dbfd7110df450ae41</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d8e86dbfd7110df450ae41</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 04 Sep 2024 23:08:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【导读】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>这是一起震惊了全世界的“炸尸”惨案。这起案件的特别之处还并不是凶手的残忍，而是通过这一起案件牵扯出了马来西亚高官的腐败。虽然案件背后的真凶看似没有定论，然而马来西亚民众的心中却似乎早就知道了这起凶案的背后指使是谁……</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="48">00:48</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;故事开篇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="49">00:49</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">02:15</a> &nbsp;大马警方接到一起失踪报案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="136">02:16</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="228">03:48</a> &nbsp;失踪者的尸体碎片被找到</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="229">03:49</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="623">10:23</a> &nbsp;死者杜雅生前的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="624">10:24</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1644">27:24</a> &nbsp;警方的调查、案件的审理以及案件背后的阴谋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1645">27:25</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1679">27:59</a> &nbsp;关于这起案件最新的消息</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1760">29:20</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;结束语</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【相关图片】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>1、阿尔丹杜雅·莎丽布</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg-rdBPvtdsQ2J7TS_OuVqR2ZYb-.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>2、阿都拉萨·巴金达</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiNjwE0tUecdGXEdD2Op2wMR-hFr.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>3、纳吉布夫妇</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgygTBxqmT4MzjdBv08XxD_wBIDO.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>4、警察总督阿兹拉和西鲁·乌马</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuBqNlOgoeGmk3FjcdGx3si6zK7V.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>5、杜雅的表妹</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq-PNWHJ88lq41aX7IvQp-83TVwy.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>6、C4炸药</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnsNHezdJRB8N4ovJNdRbiggTmxv.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/llpTafwRsU5z24pPEwistG07YV_M.m4a" length="28473615" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:29:20</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fir60aL-ZHJct8BCC8u998ik-Y0K.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>09 空调机房里的罪恶 | 香港凶案录</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d30e214a0f950f8486b822</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d30e214a0f950f8486b822</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 31 Aug 2024 12:35:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【导读】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>本期案件事发地虽在香港，但遇害者却是来自泰国，且因其特殊身份，甚至牵动了泰国官方介入，但案件真相却迟迟无法揭晓，而后发生的另外一起案件似乎带来了转机…</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="69">01:09</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;开场白</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">01:10</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1299">21:39</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;谢丽萍被害整体情况</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1300">21:40</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1990">33:10</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;丘晓彦案件始末</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1991">33:11</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2417">40:17</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;谢丽萍案真相大白</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2418">40:18</a>-结尾 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;结束语</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【相关图片】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>1、香港税务大楼</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpZ2g4JBvPCj7BNGKdmRQ9rMlyrA.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>2、案发机房</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsHOxxdAaEKojK0K08xaJ9ECwiJ1.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>3、谢丽萍（左一）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgDE4skioIuONkkTau1q3wTqwCSd.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>4、丘晓彦</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FipnVUylVZZtMXFawGf5BufynyEd.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>5、苏锦棠</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmNV4sXbGAeClmQIKAS_JB3-xG_v.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrbvZUU067dIfAAyZI8ySMmmw-f-.m4a" length="40565516" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:41:48</itunes:duration>
